      <p begin="01:59.344" end="02:01.952" ttm:agent="v1">OVO, 4L, we come out when it get dark</p>
      <p begin="02:01.952" end="02:05.825" ttm:agent="v1">Big stepper, he came in a Rolls, but he left in a stretcher</p>
