      <p begin="02:14.476" end="02:17.412" ttm:agent="v1">I be with my gun like Rozay be with lemon pepper</p>
      <p begin="02:17.412" end="02:20.289" ttm:agent="v1">She wanna hear to some afroebeats 'cause she just popped a Tesla</p>
      <p begin="02:20.289" end="02:23.169" ttm:agent="v1">All that workin' out, that nigga must think he a wrestler</p>
      <p begin="02:23.169" end="02:26.124" ttm:agent="v1">But this ain't UFC, this chopper came with a compressor</p>
