      <p begin="02:31.364" end="02:33.926" ttm:agent="v1">This Glock .45 came with a switch</p>
      <p begin="02:33.926" end="02:36.902" ttm:agent="v1">If I was Will Smith, I would've slapped him with a stick</p>
      <p begin="02:36.902" end="02:39.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Put your hands in the air, it's a stick-up (21)</p>
      <p begin="02:39.430" end="02:42.360" ttm:agent="v1">Spin the same hood where I get my d**k sucked (Facts</p>
